{"disposition":"return_to_vendor","reasoning":"Invoice INV-1016 is rejected under finding F1 because line item WidgetC is an unknown item not in the inventory catalog. Unknown items can be corrected and resubmitted, so policy requires return_to_vendor rather than void. A corrected invoice must omit or replace WidgetC and recalculate the related amounts.","vendor_reply":"Hello Widgets Inc. billing team,

We cannot process invoice INV-1016 as submitted. Line item WidgetC (quantity 3 at $350.00, amount $1,050.00) is not a recognized catalog item. Please resubmit a corrected invoice that removes WidgetC or replaces it with a valid item, and that recalculates the subtotal (currently $3,050.00), tax (currently $183.00), and total (currently $3,233.00) accordingly.

Thank you."}
